# One unused Land Cap can pay a one-white spell but cannot by itself pay a two-mana spell; its mana ability is activated during payment.
[Bot1 Deck]
Land Cap
Memnite
Swords to Plowshares
Disenchant
Island x16
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Land Cap.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Exile = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = 1
